- name: playables
  type: table
  desc: Functions for interacting with the YouTube Playables SDK.

  members:

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: first_frame_ready
    type: function
    desc: Notifies YouTube that the game has begun showing frames. This must be called before game_ready().

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: game_ready
    type: function
    desc: Notifies YouTube that the loading screen is gone and the game is ready for players to interact with. YouTube requires firstFrameReady() to be called before this function.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: load_data
    type: function
    desc: Loads serialized game data from YouTube. Only one load request may be in progress at a time.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: function

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.
        - name: data
          type: [string, nil]
          desc: The serialized game data on success, otherwise nil.
        - name: error
          type: [string, nil]
          desc: The SDK error message on failure, otherwise nil.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: save_data
    type: function
    desc: Saves a serialized string to YouTube. The string must be valid and no larger than 3 MiB. Only one save request may be in progress at a time.

    parameters:
    - name: data
      type: string
      desc: The serialized game data.
    - name: callback
      type: function

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.
        - name: success
          type: boolean
          desc: True when the save completed successfully.
        - name: error
          type: [string, nil]
          desc: The SDK error message on failure, otherwise nil.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: is_audio_enabled
    type: function
    desc: Returns whether game audio is enabled in the player's YouTube settings. Use this to initialize the game audio state.

    returns:
    - name: is_audio_enabled
      type: boolean
      desc: True when game audio is enabled.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: on_audio_enabled_change
    type: function
    desc: Registers a callback for YouTube audio-setting changes. A new callback replaces the previous one. Pass nil to unregister it.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: [function, nil]
      desc: The event callback, or nil to unregister the current callback.

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.
        - name: is_audio_enabled
          type: boolean
          desc: True when game audio should be enabled.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: on_pause
    type: function
    desc: Registers a callback for YouTube pause events. A new callback replaces the previous one. Pass nil to unregister it. A paused game is not guaranteed to resume.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: [function, nil]
      desc: The event callback, or nil to unregister the current callback.

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: on_resume
    type: function
    desc: Registers a callback for YouTube resume events. A new callback replaces the previous one. Pass nil to unregister it.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: [function, nil]
      desc: The event callback, or nil to unregister the current callback.

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: get_language
    type: function
    desc: Gets the language in the player's YouTube settings as a BCP-47 language tag. Only one request may be in progress at a time.

    parameters:
    - name: callback
      type: function

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.
        - name: language
          type: [string, nil]
          desc: The BCP-47 language tag on success, otherwise nil.
        - name: error
          type: [string, nil]
          desc: The SDK error message on failure, otherwise nil.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: send_score
    type: function
    desc: Sends an integer score to YouTube. Use one consistent score dimension across the game. Only one request may be in progress at a time.

    parameters:
    - name: score
      type: number
      desc: An integer no greater than JavaScript's maximum safe integer.
    - name: callback
      type: function

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.
        - name: success
          type: boolean
          desc: True when the request succeeded.
        - name: error
          type: [string, nil]
          desc: The SDK error message on failure, otherwise nil.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: open_yt_content
    type: function
    desc: Requests that YouTube open a video or another Playable. The content type is optional and defaults to CONTENT_TYPE_VIDEO. Only one request may be in progress at a time.

    parameters:
    - name: content_id
      type: string
      desc: The YouTube video or Playable ID.
    - name: content_type
      type: number
      optional: true
      desc: CONTENT_TYPE_VIDEO or CONTENT_TYPE_PLAYABLE.
    - name: callback
      type: function

      parameters:
        - name: self
          type: object
          desc: The calling script instance.
        - name: success
          type: boolean
          desc: True when the request succeeded. This does not guarantee that the content opened.
        - name: error
          type: [string, nil]
          desc: The SDK error message on failure, otherwise nil.

#*****************************************************************************************************

  - name: CONTENT_TYPE_VIDEO
    type: number
    desc: Opens a YouTube video.

  - name: CONTENT_TYPE_PLAYABLE
    type: number
    desc: Opens another YouTube Playable.
